PARSFILE IO_Channels\O_Channels\Export_42ba9dac-23b7-426b-bef7-84437ffb601e.par
#BlueLink1 I/O Channels: Export`Total Powertrain` Powertrain Exports` , Export`Export_42ba9dac-23b7-426b-bef7-84437ffb601e

LIVE_SERVER_UPDATE_FREQ_MAX 60

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This dataset specifies that a Simulink model is used to replace the entire CarSim 4WD powertrain.
#
#The CarSim powertrain model involves some detailed interactions between variables, so the option to Add, Replace, or Multiply the Simulink imported variables with their corresponding variables in CarSim is not available for most powertrain variables.
#
#Instead, Add is the only import mode available for most powertrain import variables, and it is necessary to specify that certain components are handled with an external model on the powertrain library screen.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

LOG_ENTRY Used Dataset: Models: Simulink; { External Powertrain } All Powertrain Components (4WD)
